{
  "slug": "harnish",
  "name": "Harnish",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Autonomous implementation engine for Claude Code. Generates PRDs (drafti), implements code autonomously (harnish), and inspects artifacts (ralphi).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `drafti-architect` (Technical design PRD generator), `drafti-feature` (Planning-based implementation spec PRD generator), `impl` (Autonomous implementation engine (the \"harnish\" engine))\n- **Hooks** (3): `PostToolUse`, `PostToolUseFailure`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install harnish@claude-community` from `jazz1x/harnish`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "hook": 3
  },
